OL,4,CBoy, 7, pulled from rubble hours after 
OL,5,CRussian strike in Ukraine, rescuers say
OL,6,GA seven-year-old boy has been rescued  
OL,7,Gfrom the rubble of a residential       
OL,8,Gbuilding near Kyiv 14 hours after a    
OL,9,GRussian strike, Ukraine's state        
OL,10,Gemergency service in the capital       
OL,11,Gregion has said.                       
OL,13,FThe attack early on Sunday morning in  
OL,14,Fthe village of Dymer killed six        
OL,15,Fpeople, Kyiv's regional head Tymur     
OL,16,FTkachenko said. Six people were        
OL,17,Finjured, while others are still        
OL,18,Fmissing.                               
